Figure 4.18: _Pseudorapidity distribution for inclusive photons for Cu+Cu collision at \(\sqrt{s_{{}_{NN}}}\)= 200 GeV. The pseudorapidity distributions for different centrality classes are shown and compared to corresponding distributions from HIJING represented by the solid lines._

